1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,860
A buddy stands on a number...

2
00:00:01,860 --> 00:00:05,620
and a whole path of tiles stretches ahead!

3
00:00:06,440 --> 00:00:08,520
This is Number Path!

4
00:00:08,520 --> 00:00:12,880
Hop from tile to tile — each one changes your number!

5
00:00:13,740 --> 00:00:15,180
Start on five...

6
00:00:16,640 --> 00:00:17,860
hop minus two...

7
00:00:18,540 --> 00:00:19,300
that's three!

8
00:00:20,700 --> 00:00:21,500
Plus one...

9
00:00:22,640 --> 00:00:23,480
that's four!

10
00:00:24,900 --> 00:00:25,800
Plus three...

11
00:00:27,020 --> 00:00:30,020
that's seven — target reached!

12
00:00:30,900 --> 00:00:35,360
Every hop counts — plan your path to land right on the goal!

13
00:00:36,760 --> 00:00:42,020
Parents — this builds planning and sequential reasoning, one hop at a time!

14
00:00:43,220 --> 00:00:49,040
Tap Math Game Zone, hop into Number Path, pick your level, and start hopping!

15
00:00:49,040 --> 00:00:54,540
Abacus Kids — grab it free on the App Store and Google Play!
